   "type": "text",
   "title": "毎年恒例の健康診断。その女医は痴女だった!痴女医の診察シーンをVRで360度観覧。",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "毎年恒例の健康診断。今年もチャチャっと済ませてしまおう。<br />\n<br />\n「さあ、次の方どうぞ」<br />\n<br />\nその部屋に入って僕が遭遇したのは。。。<br />\n<br />\nなんと、痴女医。<br />\n<br />\n「隅々まで診察させて頂くわね」<br />\n<br />\nそう言って彼女は、僕の体を弄び始めた・・・<br />\n<br />\nフリーズしたシーンをVRで360度観覧!<br />\n<br />\nOculus Rift、HTC Viveに対応。<br />\n約10分ほどのVR体験です。<br />\n<br />\n=== <br />\nENGLISH<br />\n<br />\nYou just wanted it to be over with - your annual checkup. <br />\nYou show up, wanting it to be over before it begins. <br />\nYou enter the office, open the door. You can't believe it - your doctor is a straight up TEN. <br />\n<br />\nYour eyes meet. Now, all you want is this exam to go on as thoroughly and as long as possible. <br />\nThis is the moment you'll imagine every night before your head hits the pillow -- and now YOU get to experience it, frozen in time. <br />\n<br />\nNavigate around the scene and explore this amazing scene of pure ecstasy.<br />\n<br />\nFor Oculus Rift and HTC Vive<br />\nAbout 10 min of entertainment"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
